{"reviews":[{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-0","r":5.0,"t":"Happy Wife, happy life!","x":"I ordered these for my wife. I knew that she wanted a good set of make up brushes. When I saw this good deal I couldn't pass them up. It's now been 4 days since she got them and she has used them everyday. She said the options available and the feel of the brushes definitely set these apart.  Based on her input I highly recommend them!","h":13,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-1","r":2.0,"t":"Defective eyeliner brush","x":"The thin eyeliner brush was defective. It had no hair. Just a stick. Too much trouble to send back. UPDATE:  The brushes fall off the handles.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-2","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome Make up brushes!!!","x":"I LOVE these brushes! They are so soft. And they do such a good job spreading and applying my makeup. They are very precise and with the multitude of brushes to choose from, there is no limit to how creative you can be with your makeup application! Definitely a product to have in your make up drawer!  I received this product for free in exchange for an unbiased review.","h":8,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-3","r":1.0,"t":"You can actually tell that all of the reviews are ...","x":"You can actually tell that all of the reviews are fake because they are all around the same date and say about the same thing. P.s. A lot of them don't say verified purchase on them. For that reason I'm out.","h":8,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-4","r":5.0,"t":"Great quality, well packaged","x":"These are the softest makeup brushes I've ever used! Great quality, well packaged, and very versatile. I love how the carrying case keeps everything neat and organized. I would definitely recommend these for anyone who loves makeup!  I received this product at a discounted rate in exchange for an unbiased review.","h":6,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-5","r":5.0,"t":"Fabulous","x":"[[ASIN:B01CZNI0KG Insane Deal! Ends Today! Pure Arielle Professional 24 Piece All Natural Real Hair Makeup Brush Set - Handle Pcs Cosmetic Beauty Brushes Kit - Make Up Leather Organizer Case / Bag - Not Cheap Synthetic]]. This was an incredible deal..Thanks so much. I received this at a discounted price","h":6,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-6","r":5.0,"t":"This is a great product! SO many brush options and fairly compact","x":"This is a great product! SO many brush options and fairly compact. I'm not a make-up artist so I won't be using it in a professional manner, but this is so perfect for every day use. The brushes are very soft and do not shed at all. I would highly recommend this product.","h":5,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-7","r":5.0,"t":"Great product that my wife really enjoys","x":"Great product that my wife really enjoys. It's a little big (as in quantity of brushes) but she loves it.","h":4,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-8","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"It is great and very soft. I'd definitely recommend for others.","h":4,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-9","r":5.0,"t":"Great Buy & Great customer service","x":"This is a good buy for the price. The brushes are good quality and are very soft on the face when used. You will have everything u need to apply all the makeup u want. I'd recommend this to those who are just getting started with getting their makeup set together and also those who just want to add another set of brushes to their collection :)  I was impressed by the customer service they provide as well. They are very connected to their customers and they give you updates all throughout when yo","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-10","r":5.0,"t":"I absolutely love these brushes","x":"I absolutely love these brushes!!! They are exactly what I was looking for - a professional type brush at a price I can afford! I was surprised by the awesome carrying case that they arrived in!!  Customer service was phenomenal!","h":3,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-11","r":5.0,"t":"These are great! Extra soft","x":"These are great! Extra soft, many shapes and textures for great blending and precision. Sturdy and well made! Wonderful brushes!","h":3,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-12","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing Brushes","x":"I love my new makeup brushes. A few days later I received an email that explained my brushes and gave helpful tips.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-13","r":5.0,"t":"Love it","x":"Brushes are extremly soft, havent tested Them out yet but i do truly believe i will end up with great results.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-14","r":5.0,"t":"Great brushes","x":"These brushes are so soft and wash up beautifully.","h":3,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-15","r":5.0,"t":"This product is absolutely amazing! I have been searching for a good set ...","x":"This product is  absolutely amazing!  I have been searching for a good set of make-up brushes..that are high quality for a long time and I can honestly say that I found them!  Super excited!  Happy to know I made a good choice!  By the way the customer service is also amazing  just like their product!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-16","r":3.0,"t":"good for starters","x":"well, the quality is fine, no big smell,brushes are soft. but there is no difference among those eyeshadow brushes,and no angle brushes.but i am still recommend this set to starters, since we don't actually need that much brushes","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-17","r":5.0,"t":"These brushes are great!!","x":"These brushes are great!!!  I bought them as a gift for my grandchildren and they love them.  They were so excited to get these,  they said they work very good and there is such a big variety of brushes.","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-18","r":5.0,"t":"The case rolls up nicely and secured with a tie","x":"Lovely brushes.  The case rolls up nicely and secured with a tie, making this set good for travel.  The brush handles feel very nice to hold.  Very happy with this purchase","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-19","r":5.0,"t":"Great brushes","x":"Every brush I've ever wanted is here. So far, no hairs have come loose and gotten stuck in my make-up. The brushes are very soft and feel good on my skin.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-20","r":5.0,"t":"Very nice set","x":"Arrived quickly and appears to be a very quality set of brushes. The case is also nice and even allows two spaces to store any existing brushes.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-21","r":5.0,"t":"brushes better than what I expected","x":"brushes better than what I expected, great quality! on top of that, their customer service is hassle-free-- will definitely buy from them again!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-22","r":1.0,"t":"I'm glad I didn't buy them when they were full price","x":"I'm not a fan of these brushes at all. And the case is also very cheap. I'm glad I didn't buy them when they were full price!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-23","r":5.0,"t":"Great quality product","x":"It was a gift and I was very happy with the quality .I would definitely purchase this item again.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2016"},{"id":"B01CZNI0KG-24","r":4.0,"t":"Nice for the money","x":"Very soft, but most of the smaller brushes are the same. No blending brushes.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2016"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the brushes as very soft and gentle on the face.","cites":[3,5,7,9,10,12,14,15]},{"text":"Many praise the wide variety of brush options and the included carrying case for organization and versatility.","cites":[1,3,5,7,10,11,12]},{"text":"Several reviewers consider the set a great value for the price and recommend it, including for beginners.","cites":[1,6,10,11]},{"text":"A few reviewers report quality problems, such as a defective eyeliner brush and brush heads falling off the handles.","cites":[2]},{"text":"One reviewer suspects the reviews are fake due to similar dates and wording and lack of verified purchase labels.","cites":[4]}]},"qa":[]}